                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<p><milestone type="pagelike" unit="item" n="S"/><label xml:lang="eng">Southern doorjamb</label>
   <lb n="S1"/>[śrī siddhi svasti jaya] 843 śaka nu kaṁsteṅ Añ śrīmahīdharavarmma nive-
   <lb n="S2"/>[dana vnvak {3} bhaga]vatī kamrateṅ Añ vraḥ śrīy @ vnvak ta gi sruk gaṁryyaṅ
   <lb n="S3"/>[Aṁraḥ khñuṁ gho dha]rmma I gho kanleṅ I gho chpoṅ I gho kañcū I gho phtal I gho
   <lb n="S4"/>{2} [gho] thleṁ I gho panlas I tai thgal I si rat thgot I tai thkan I tai saṁqap I tai saṁqa-
   <lb n="S5"/>[p] {4} pau panlas I tai rat gandha I tai chke I tai kanrau I tai khñuṁ vraḥ I tai pau so
   <lb n="S6"/>{5} tai pau I si rat chpoṅ I tai kanso I tai kaṁvvaṅ I si rat khñuṁ vraḥ I lap
   <lb n="S7"/>{2} I si kañjai I si rat thleṁ I tai thgau I tai panlas I tai {3} I tai pau panheṁ I tai dyan I
   <lb n="S8"/>{4} pau I tai A pandan I tai A vraḥ śrīy I gho lvan sunetra I gho lvan
   <lb n="S9"/>khmau I gho lvan ratnarāja I gho lvan jñānotsava I gvāl lvan pavitra I tai lvan kante-
   <lb n="S10"/> ṅ I tai lvan kaṁprvat I lap saṁqap tai rat I si pau I gho lvan khmau sot I piṇḍa Aṁraḥ I
   <lb n="S11"/>{4} 6 si rat 4 tai rat I si pau I tai pau 3 tai A 2 gho lvan {1} gvāl lvan I tai lva-
   <lb n="S12"/>[n] {3} I tai rat I si pau phsaṁ 40 10 9 @ Aṁraḥ khñuṁ I gho {3} gho {2} gho {3}
   <lb n="S13"/>{4} gho kañcan I gho thgap I gho sarac I gho thleṁ I gvāl {7}
   <lb n="S14"/>{6} I gvāl śrī I gvāl saṁqap I tai kanteṅ I tai {9}
   <lb n="S15"/>{7} I tai phnos I tai kaṁvī I tai dharmma I tai saṁqap I tai {8}
   <lb n="S16"/>{8}t I si rat krau I si rat vrahey I tai rat {7}
   <lb n="S17"/>{7} tai pau laṅgāy I gho lvan kanrap I gho lvan śrī I tai lvan
   <lb n="S18"/>phgal I {5}t I tai {6} piṇḍa Aṁraḥ I gho 6 gvāl 6
   <lb n="S19"/>tai 10 2 {6} 2 {6} [lva]n 3 lap lvan I phsaṁ 20 10 9 <g ref="sym:circle-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g>
   <lb n="S20"/>vnvak ta gi sruk {14} gho krau I gho kanqas I
   <lb n="S21"/>gho kaṁprvat {15} gvāl pavitra I gvā-
   <lb n="S22"/>[l] thleṁ I gvāl kan{15} tai mak I tai kaṁvaḥ I
   <lb n="S23"/>tai kaṁprvat I tai kaṁvr̥k I {12}ṅ I tai kaṁpit I
   <lb n="S24"/>lap kanhyaṅ I lap kaṁ{12} raṁnoc I
   <lb n="S25"/>tai vraḥ śrīy I tai {15} lvan kaṁpi
   <lb n="S26"/>gho lvan pandan I gho lvan {15}ṇa I pi
   <lb n="S27"/>ṇḍa Aṁraḥ I gho 7 gvāl {1} si {15} phsaṁ 20 10 8 <g ref="sym:circle-hollow" type="punctuation">.</g>
</p>
